Package: wispo
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pip, python3-venv, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpulse0
Recommends: intel-opencl-icd, intel-level-zero-gpu
Maintainer: Faraz Ali <farazali9028@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Master-Faraz/Wispo
Description: Local offline speech-to-text dictation service for Linux
 Wispo provides instant offline push-to-talk speech transcription
 accelerated by whisper.cpp and Intel Arc SYCL or CPU AVX2.
 It injects transcribed text directly into any focused application window.
